  {
    "part_type": 89,
    "name": "Trans-Roto-Matic",
    "description": "This handy gadget turns translational motion (back and forth) into rotational energy (around in circles). Tie a rope to the eye hook, then tug it with another object to make the gear turn. Hitch a belt to the gear and use it to rotate pinwheels, conveyors, and other rotating parts.",
    "solve_name": "Trans-Roto-Matic",
